{"nodes": [{"id": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "label": "SPA Salon Reservation System Design Spec", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L1-L258", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single source of intent for the Ireq SPA Salon platform: .NET 8 DDD backend + React 18 SPA + SQL Server, bilingual AR/EN, social login, multi-channel notifications, loyalty and waitlist. Phase 1 explicitly excludes payments, native apps, multi-branch, video consultation and inventory to keep the first release shippable."}, {"id": "design_CleanArchitectureDdd", "label": "Clean Architecture with DDD layering", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L33-L38", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four layers (API / Application / Domain / Infrastructure) with the hard rule that Domain holds aggregates, value objects, domain events and repository interfaces and has NO infrastructure dependencies. This is why SharedKernel's IDomainEvent and ValueObject are empty/minimal markers and why IRepository lives in Domain while EF Core implementations live in Infrastructure."}, {"id": "design_CqrsMediatr", "label": "CQRS via MediatR in the Application layer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L35-L36", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Application layer is defined as CQRS (MediatR) plus DTOs, FluentValidation validators and AutoMapper, so each use case is a command/query handler that owns its own transaction rather than a service class shared across endpoints."}, {"id": "design_FeatureSlicedFrontend", "label": "Feature-Sliced frontend architecture", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L40-L42", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Feature folders colocate components, hooks and API calls by domain area, mirroring the backend's bounded contexts so a change to one context touches one folder on each side."}, {"id": "design_BookingsBoundedContext", "label": "Bookings bounded context", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L44-L51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Declared the core context: Booking aggregate root, BookingSlot value object, five domain events (Created/Confirmed/Cancelled/Completed/NoShow) and three business rules \u2014 no double-booking, slots aligned to staff working hours, 2h minimum cancellation notice."}, {"id": "design_ServicesBoundedContext", "label": "Services bounded context", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L53-L56", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SalonService carries paired NameAr/NameEn and DescriptionAr/DescriptionEn columns plus IsActive soft-delete, and is partitioned by eight fixed categories from HaircutStyling to EyelashEyebrow."}, {"id": "design_StaffBoundedContext", "label": "Staff bounded context", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L58-L62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "StaffMember is the aggregate root with WorkingSchedule and TimeOff as child entities, and specialties are modelled as SpecialtyServiceIds (id references) rather than an entity relation so Staff stays independent of the Services context."}, {"id": "design_CustomersBoundedContext", "label": "Customers bounded context", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L64-L68", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Customer stores PreferredLanguage plus ExternalAuthId/Provider (no local password), and loyalty is an append-only LoyaltyTransaction ledger alongside the denormalised LoyaltyPoints balance so history is auditable."}, {"id": "design_NotificationsBoundedContext", "label": "Notifications bounded context", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L70-L75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Notification is persisted per attempt with Channel, Type, Status, SentAt and Error so delivery failures across SendGrid/Twilio SMS/WhatsApp/web-push are retryable rather than fire-and-forget; reminder jobs are scheduled at the moment a booking is confirmed."}, {"id": "design_WaitlistBoundedContext", "label": "Waitlist bounded context", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L77-L81", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WaitlistEntry is its own aggregate root holding CustomerId, ServiceId, PreferredStaffId and PreferredDate, so demand for a fully booked slot is captured without creating a phantom Booking."}, {"id": "design_IdentityBoundedContext", "label": "Identity and auth context", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L83-L87", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ASP.NET Core Identity plus Google/Facebook OAuth with short-lived JWTs (15min access, 7d refresh) and four roles (Customer/Staff/Admin/SuperAdmin); social-only login removes password storage from scope."}, {"id": "design_BookingStatusFsm", "label": "Booking status state machine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L49", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pending to Confirmed, then one of Completed, Cancelled or NoShow. Bookings start unconfirmed so an admin (or an availability re-check) gates them, and the three terminal states let analytics separate genuine cancellations from no-shows."}, {"id": "design_WaitlistStatusFsm", "label": "Waitlist status state machine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L80", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Waiting to Offered, then Booked or Expired. The intermediate Offered state exists so a freed slot is reserved for one customer at a time instead of racing the whole waitlist."}, {"id": "design_NoDoubleBookingRule", "label": "No overlapping bookings per staff member", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L51,L211", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A staff member cannot hold overlapping bookings; this is a cross-aggregate invariant (it needs the set of a staff member's bookings), so it cannot be enforced inside StaffMember or a single Booking instance and must live in a query/handler-level collision check."}, {"id": "design_TwoHourCancellationRule", "label": "Two-hour minimum cancellation notice", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L51,L213", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cancellations inside two hours of the appointment are rejected, protecting staff from unrecoverable idle time; admins may still override via the admin panel."}, {"id": "design_SlotGenerationRule", "label": "Slot generation from staff working hours", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L212", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Availability is derived, never stored: slots are generated from each staff member's WorkingSchedule at 30-minute intervals, widened when a service exceeds 30 minutes, so changing working hours instantly changes offered slots."}, {"id": "design_LoyaltyPointsRule", "label": "Loyalty points earning and redemption rule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L68,L214", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "10 points per COMPLETED booking (explicitly not on confirmation, so no-shows and cancellations cannot farm points) and 100 points redeem for one admin-defined free service."}, {"id": "design_WaitlistOfferWindow", "label": "Waitlist offer and expiry window", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L203,L215", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An offer is made to the first matching customer who then has 24h to accept, while a daily Hangfire job expires entries older than 48h; together they stop a freed slot being held hostage by an unresponsive customer."}, {"id": "design_WaitlistCancellationTrigger", "label": "Cancellation-triggered waitlist matching", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L81,L215", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When a booking is cancelled the system scans the waitlist for matching entries and notifies them via the WaitlistAvailable notification type, recycling the freed capacity automatically instead of leaving the slot to be rediscovered by browsing."}, {"id": "design_AdminOverrideRule", "label": "Admin override of business rules", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L216", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Admins can override any business rule from the admin panel \u2014 an explicit escape hatch so real-world salon exceptions do not require a code change, at the cost of invariants not being absolute at the domain layer."}, {"id": "design_HangfireBackgroundJobs", "label": "Hangfire background job schedule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L196-L204", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four recurring jobs (24h reminders daily at 8 AM, 1h reminders hourly, waitlist expiry daily, notification retry every 15 min) run in-process with SQL Server storage, avoiding a separate worker deployment in Phase 1."}, {"id": "design_CalendarBookingFlow", "label": "Calendar-first booking flow", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L185-L191", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single-page funnel \u2014 FullCalendar month view, click a date, slide-in slot panel, service picker, auto-suggested or manual staff, review and confirm \u2014 chosen so the customer never leaves the page and sees availability before committing to a service."}, {"id": "design_BilingualRtlSupport", "label": "Bilingual AR/EN with RTL layout", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L179-L183", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "i18next ar/en namespaces with a dir=\"rtl\" toggle on the root element and RTL-aware calendar and form layouts; content that is genuinely per-language (service names, descriptions) is duplicated in the schema rather than translated at runtime."}, {"id": "design_GlassmorphismDarkTheme", "label": "Dark glassmorphism visual theme", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L169-L177", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deep charcoal background with electric purple to magenta gradients, translucent blurred cards, Cairo for Arabic and Inter for English, and Framer Motion transitions \u2014 a luxury-salon register chosen to differentiate from utilitarian booking tools."}, {"id": "design_PhaseOneScopeBoundary", "label": "Phase 1 scope boundary", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L245-L258", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Online payments, native mobile apps, multi-branch/franchise, video consultation and inventory are all deferred; deployment is also out of scope. This is why Booking carries no payment state and no branch/tenant discriminator anywhere in the domain model."}], "edges": [{"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_CleanArchitectureDdd", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L33-L38", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_CqrsMediatr", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L35", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_FeatureSlicedFrontend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L40-L42", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_BookingsBoundedContext", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L44-L51", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_ServicesBoundedContext", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L53-L56", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_StaffBoundedContext", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L58-L62", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_CustomersBoundedContext", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L64-L68", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_NotificationsBoundedContext", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L70-L75", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_WaitlistBoundedContext", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L77-L81", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_IdentityBoundedContext", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L83-L87", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_HangfireBackgroundJobs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L196-L204", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_CalendarBookingFlow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L185-L191", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_BilingualRtlSupport", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L179-L183", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_GlassmorphismDarkTheme", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L169-L177", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_SpaSalonReservationDesignSpec", "target": "design_PhaseOneScopeBoundary", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L245-L258", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_StaffBoundedContext", "target": "staffmember_StaffMember", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L59", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_StaffBoundedContext", "target": "workingschedule_WorkingSchedule", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L60", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_StaffBoundedContext", "target": "timeoff_TimeOff", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L61", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_StaffBoundedContext", "target": "istaffrepository_IStaffRepository", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L58-L62", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_WaitlistBoundedContext", "target": "waitlistentry_WaitlistEntry", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location": "L78", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_WaitlistBoundedContext", "target": "iwaitlistrepository_IWaitlistRepository", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-20-spa-salon-reservation-design.md", "source_location